{
 "title": "元组",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "**元组**无需定义结构体，就能把几个值放在一起：`(100, 3.14, \"Greengold\")`。用 `.0`、`.1`、`.2` 访问元素。它最常见的用途是从函数返回多个值。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn divmod(a: i32, b: i32) -> (i32, i32):",
    "    return (a / b, a % b)",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    res = divmod(17, 5)",
    "    print(\"quotient:\", res.0, \"remainder:\", res.1)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "quotient: 3 remainder: 2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "**解构**可以在一行中把元组拆成独立的变量。不需要的元素可以用 `_` 跳过。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn divmod(a: i32, b: i32) -> (i32, i32):",
    "    return (a / b, a % b)",
    "",
    "fn user() -> (i32, str, str):",
    "    return (101, \"Ali Veli\", \"ali@example.com\")",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    quotient, remainder = divmod(27, 4)",
    "    print(quotient, remainder)",
    "    id, _, email = user()",
    "    print(id, email)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "6 3",
    "101 ali@example.com"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c04-l03-x1",
   "prompt": "让 `min_max(a, b, c)` 返回一个元组：最小数和最大数。把它解构，并输出 `3 9`（针对 `min_max(5, 3, 9)`）。",
   "starter": [
    "fn min_max(a: i32, b: i32, c: i32) -> (i32, i32):",
    "    return (0, 0)",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    lo, hi = min_max(5, 3, 9)",
    "    print(lo, hi)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn min_max(a: i32, b: i32, c: i32) -> (i32, i32):",
    "    lo = a",
    "    hi = a",
    "    if b < lo:",
    "        lo = b",
    "    if c < lo:",
    "        lo = c",
    "    if b > hi:",
    "        hi = b",
    "    if c > hi:",
    "        hi = c",
    "    return (lo, hi)",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    lo, hi = min_max(5, 3, 9)",
    "    print(lo, hi)"
   ],
   "hint": "让 `lo` 和 `hi` 都从 `a` 开始，通过与 `b`、`c` 比较来更新它们。",
   "expected": [
    "3 9"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c04-l03-q1",
   "q": "当 `t = (7, \"a\")` 时，`t.1` 是什么？",
   "options": [
    "7",
    "\"a\"",
    "一个错误"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "计数从 0 开始：`.0` 是第一个元素，`.1` 是第二个。"
  }
 ]
}
